# Thespian's Stage becomes a Dark Depths with no ice counters and wins the legend rule (CR 704.5j); its state trigger goes on the
# stack (CR 603.8). In response Bot1 flashes in Pestermite, untaps the Stage (CR 701.26b), and uses the Stage's own copy ability
# again to become a copy of Bot2's Island (CR 707.2: the newer copy effect overwrites the older). The trigger has no
# intervening "if" (CR 603.4): as it resolves "sacrifice it" is the same object, an Island now but still on the battlefield, so
# it is sacrificed, and because it was, Bot1 creates Marit Lage (CR 608.2c).

